 let-7f in UCI-101 cell line.</title></caption><graphic id="pone-0002436-t004-4" xlink:href="pone.0002436.t004"/><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" alternate-form-of="pone-0002436-t004-4"><colgroup span="1"><col align="left" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/></colgroup><thead><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">mir-34c</td><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">mir-98</td><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">mir-424</td><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">let-7f</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Symbol</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Z-ratio</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Symbol</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Z-ratio</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Symbol</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Z-ratio</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Symbol</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Z-ratio</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>FLNC</italic></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5.03</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>HIST1H4C</italic></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5.85</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>HIST1H4C</italic></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5.27</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>KIF1A</italic></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">7.89</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>MT1A</italic></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.17</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>PSAT1</italic></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.02</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>ID1</italic></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">3.65</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" co